# Tenable

> AI-powered exposure management platform and broad cybersecurity partner. Tenable unifies security visibility across cloud, IT/OT, web applications, identity, and agentic AI — helping more than 40,000 organizations worldwide find, prioritize, and close exposures before they become breaches.

## Products
### Tenable One — Exposure Management Platform
> AI-powered platform unifying visibility, insight, and action across the entire attack surface.
- [Tenable One](https://www.tenable.com/products/tenable-one): The flagship AI-powered exposure management platform. Consolidates risk across IT, OT, cloud, identity, web apps, and AI.
- [Tenable One Vulnerability Management](https://www.tenable.com/products/vulnerability-management): Cloud-based vulnerability management with risk-based prioritization across all assets.
- [Tenable One Attack Surface Management](https://www.tenable.com/products/attack-surface-management): External attack surface discovery and EASM; inventories internet-facing assets and unknown risks.
- [Tenable One Identity Exposure](https://www.tenable.com/products/identity-exposure): Continuous Active Directory and Entra ID security; detects misconfigurations and identity-based attack paths.
- [Tenable One OT Exposure](https://www.tenable.com/products/ot-security): Unified OT/IT security for industrial control systems (ICS); passive and active detection without disrupting operations.
- [Tenable One Web App Scanning](https://www.tenable.com/products/web-app-scanning): Automated vulnerability scanning for web applications and APIs; low false-positive, safe for production environments.
- [Tenable One AI Exposure](https://www.tenable.com/products/ai-exposure): Detects shadow AI, tracks AI tool usage, and reduces attack surface exposure from agentic AI and LLM deployments.
- [Tenable One Cloud Exposure (CNAPP)](https://www.tenable.com/cloud-security/products/cnapp): Cloud-native application protection platform (CNAPP) covering CSPM, CIEM, DSPM, cloud vulnerability management, and workload security.

### Standalone & On-Premises Products
- [Nessus](https://www.tenable.com/products/nessus): Industry gold standard vulnerability scanner. Available as Nessus Pro (teams) and Nessus Expert (modern attack surfaces including cloud).
- [Tenable Security Center](https://www.tenable.com/products/security-center): On-premises vulnerability management with continuous monitoring, risk-based prioritization, and compliance reporting.
- [Tenable Network Monitor](https://www.tenable.com/products/network-monitor): Passive network security monitoring for continuous asset visibility — including unmanaged and IoT devices — without active scanning.
- [Tenable Patch Management](https://www.tenable.com/products/patch-management): Autonomous remediation with guardrails and SLAs; bridges security and IT for faster mean-time-to-remediate.
- [Tenable PCI ASV](https://www.tenable.com/products/pci-asv): PCI Approved Scanning Vendor (ASV) integration for Vulnerability Management and Web App Scanning; simplifies PCI DSS compliance.

## Solutions
- [Exposure Management](https://www.tenable.com/exposure-management): Unified attack surface visibility spanning AI, OT, IT, cloud, and identity; underpins continuous threat exposure management (CTEM).
- [Vulnerability Management](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/vulnerability-management): Risk-based vulnerability management combining industry-leading assessment with business-context prioritization.
- [Cloud Security](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/cloud-security): Multi-cloud security across CNAPP, CSPM, DSPM, and KSPM disciplines.
- [AI Security](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/ai-security): AI security posture management (AI-SPM) across cloud, identities, agents, and data; closes AI exposure gaps.
- [Active Directory Security](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/active-directory): Continuous AD and Entra ID protection against misconfigurations and identity-based attacks.
- [OT/ICS Security](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/cyber-physical-systems): Secures converged IT/OT environments and industrial control systems without operational disruption.
- [Ransomware Defense](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/ransomware): Risk-based vulnerability and AD misconfiguration visibility to block ransomware attack paths.
- [Zero Trust](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/zero-trust): Supports zero trust with continuous asset monitoring, least-privilege enforcement, and over-privileged account detection.
- [Compliance](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/compliance): Automates priority controls across NIST, PCI, HIPAA, and other regulatory frameworks.
- [NIST Cybersecurity Framework](https://www.tenable.com/solutions/nist-cybersecurity-framework): Maps Tenable capabilities to NIST CSF functions for streamlined framework adoption.

